# 📖 TOEIC Grammar - Day 11

## Topic
# Causative & Perception Verbs
### (make / let / have / help / see / hear / watch)

---

## 1. Causative Verbs (사역동사)

사역동사는 "누군가에게 ~하게 하다"라는 의미를 가진다.

### make + 목적어 + 동사원형

Examples

- My boss made me work late.
- The movie made me cry.

---

### let + 목적어 + 동사원형

Examples

- My parents let me drive the car.
- Please let me know.

---

### have + 목적어 + 동사원형

Examples

- I had him fix my computer.
- She had the staff prepare the room.

---

### help + 목적어 + (to)동사원형

Examples

- He helped me carry the boxes.
- He helped me to carry the boxes.

둘 다 가능하다.

---

## 2. Perception Verbs (지각동사)

see / hear / watch / feel + 목적어 + 동사원형 또는 -ing

Examples

- I saw him cross the street. (끝까지 봄)
- I saw him crossing the street. (진행 중인 모습)

- We heard her sing.
- We heard her singing.

---

## Remember

| Verb | Structure |
|-------|-----------|
| make | O + V |
| let | O + V |
| have | O + V |
| help | O + V / O + to V |
| see | O + V / V-ing |
| hear | O + V / V-ing |

---

## TOEIC Tip

사역동사 뒤에는 **동사원형**이 오는 경우가 가장 많다.

❌ made me to work

✅ made me work
